{"id":"648170","name":"艾草麦麸馒头","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/648170/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"麦麸面粉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"艾草","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"3g"},{"name":"小苏打","amount":"2g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"艾草。","img":"images/648170/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中水烧开，加入小苏打，下入艾草焯水。","img":"images/648170/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"捞出过凉水。","img":"images/648170/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"攥干水分，放入搅拌机。","img":"images/648170/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入150mI的清水。","img":"images/648170/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌成汁。","img":"images/648170/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"全麦面粉加入酵母。","img":"images/648170/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入打好的艾草汁。","img":"images/648170/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入适量的糖。","img":"images/648170/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"和成面团后，放入猪油，可提升馒头的光泽度。","img":"images/648170/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"和好的面团。","img":"images/648170/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜，温室发酵30分钟。","img":"images/648170/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"发酵好的面。","img":"images/648170/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"取出，揉搓排气。","img":"images/648170/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"搓成长条。","img":"images/648170/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"切成等量的小面剂。","img":"images/648170/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"撒点干面粉防粘。","img":"images/648170/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"挪成圆形。","img":"images/648170/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"放入蒸锅。","img":"images/648170/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"再次醒发20分钟，大火蒸15分钟即可，蒸好的馒头焖上5分钟再开盖，防止塌陷。","img":"images/648170/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"时间到，一股艾草的芳香。","img":"images/648170/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。带着青草芳香的馒头，一口下去满满的春天的味道。","img":"images/648170/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}